<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Basis levels mostly down.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Basis levels mostly down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basis levels for dark northern spring wheat were mostly lower in line with weaker MGE wheat futures, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;During the last 10 days we were pretty busy,&quot; a Montana dealer said, referring to some movement.</p>
<p>He noted that flour mills were buying the lower protein spring wheat at 12 to 12.5 percent. &quot;But coming into this Thursday and Friday, we have seen the (MGE) futures coming down a little bit,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>MGE wheat ended lower with March down 4-1/4 cents per bushel at $3.92-1/2.  </p>
